{
 "about": "Stills and portraits for the got mod (Game of Thrones, HBO 2011-2019), for the private Entrika fan game. Keys follow the game ids: char.<id> Characters, comp.<id> Retainers (Kul), card.<id> Schemes, crisis.<id> Crises, term.hizmet / term.hiyanet the Raven (Kader) cards. Each candidate: file (in this folder, long edge <= 1600 px, JPEG q80), size [w,h], source_url (the image), source_page (where it was found), note (who or what is in frame, plus concerns), focus [x,y] = subject centre as fractions (Character and Retainer faces from macOS Vision; scenes set by eye), usable as CSS object-position; posed = an official HBO portrait (true) or a screencap (false). The first candidate is the pick; status 'weak' marks a stand-in worth replacing.",
 "people": "Characters and Retainers keep their season 1-2 look. Most portraits are HBO's own character images from hbo.com's cast-and-crew pages (16:9, head and shoulders), fetched from the Wayback Machine because hbo.com now redirects to Max. Where HBO had none (Ilyn Payne, Loras, Ros's season 1 look, a season 1 Jaime), a wiki screencap is used.",
 "not_covered": {
  "amb.*": "Ambitions are icon-only by design; no stills.",
  "cutout": "Character cut-outs and crops wait for the skin refactor's cut-out tool.",
  "grade": "The Red Keep dusk grade is applied later, as for muhtesem."
 },
 "frieze": {
  "row": [
   "char.rustem",
   "char.hurrem",
   "char.suleyman",
   "char.ibrahim",
   "char.hatice",
   "char.mustafa"
  ],
  "note": "Littlefinger, Cersei, Robert (centre, largest), Ned, Varys, Joffrey, cut from their -1 portraits. Cersei, Ned, Littlefinger and Varys sit on soft, even backgrounds that should cut out cleanly; Robert (wicker behind the crown) and Joffrey (the Iron Throne's blades behind him) are busy and may need hand cleanup."
 },
 "rights": "All stills and portraits belong to HBO. Private, non-commercial use among friends only; do not publish the game or these files.",
